<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Provenance Tracking in Large-Scale Machine Learning Systems</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Gabriele Padovani
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_institution">University of Trento</span>, <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_city">Trento</span>, <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_country">Italy</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">email: </span><a href="mailto:gabriele.padovani@unitn.it">gabriele.padovani@unitn.it</a>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">, </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
